13.33 S TJ=EM^2/(2*EF+1)*(EF+1)*(EF)
13.34 S TJ=(-1)^(EF-EM)*FSQT(TJ); GOTO 13.45
13.36 S TJ=(EF-1-EM(*(EF-EM)/(2*EF+1)*(2*EF)*(2*EF-1)
13.37 S TJ=(-1)^(EF-EM)*FSQT(TJ); GOTO 13.45
13(39 S J=(EF+EM)*(EF-EM)*2/(2*EF+1)*(2*EF)*(2*EF-1)
13.40 S TJ=(-1)^(EF-EM)*FSQT(TJ); GOTO 13.45
13.45 S TJ=TJ*SI; S SI=1; IF (SJ+1)13.50,13.47,13.50
13.47 DO 13.70
13.50 S SJ=1; IF (SS+1)13.55,13.52,13.55
13.52 DO 13.71
